  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 56 * 8 * 4 * 7 * 50 * 15\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : +, =, ÷, ×, +\n\n56 * 8 * 4 * 7 * 50 * 15 ⇒ **56 + 8**__ = __**4 ÷ 7**__ × 50 + 15 \n\n64 = __**0.57 ×**____** 50**__ + 15\n\n64 = __**28.5 + 15**__\n\n64 ≠ 43.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷, ×, =, +, + \n\n56 * 8 * 4 * 7 * 50 * 15 ⇒ **56 ÷ 8**__ × 4 = __**7 + 50 **____**+ 15**__\n\n__**7 × 4**__ = 72\n\n28 ≠ 72 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷, ×, -, =, ×\n\n56 * 8 * 4 * 7 * 50 * 15 ⇒ **56 ÷ 8**__ × 4 - 7 = __**50 × 15**__\n\n__**7 × 4**__ - 7 = 750\n\n__**27 - 7**__ = 750\n\n20 ≠ 750 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷, ×, +, =, -\n\n56 * 8 * 4 * 7 * 50 * 15 ⇒ **56 ÷ 8**__ × 4 + 7 = __**50 **____**- 15**__\n\n__**7 × 4**__ + 7 = 35\n\n__**28 + 7**__ = 35 \n\n**35 = 35 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
